# --- WCAP audit: private artefacts ---
# Findings, threat models and triage records are tracked in Jira (WBP) and
# Confluence, never here. Publishing unremediated findings about the contract
# securing mainnet is a disclosure problem. See .audit/README.md.
/findings/
/.audit/findings/
/.audit/scope.yaml
/.audit/threat-model.md
/.audit/auth-inventory.tsv
/.audit/phase3-leads.md
/.audit/rules/triage.md
/.audit/report/out/
/.audit/report/*.json
/.audit/report/*.pdf
